Ledger and Ledlight produce the same open lot gains.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight unrealized-gains

========== LEDGER-CLI ==========

ledger --args-only --date-format %Y-%m-%d --no-pager --sort account --gain balance --flat --no-total --format '%1(display_total)  %(account)\n'

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  default
  format 1,000.00 USD
commodity AAPL
  format 1000 AAPL
account Assets:Broker
account Assets:Bank
account Income:Capital Gains

P 2024-02-01 AAPL 120 USD

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Broker  10 AAPL {{1000 USD}}
  Assets:Bank  -1000 USD

2024-02-01 Partial sale
  Assets:Broker  -4 AAPL {100 USD} @ 120 USD
  Assets:Bank  480 USD
  Income:Capital Gains  -80 USD

========== OUTPUT ==========

120.00 USD  Assets:Broker
